  "tagline": "Lakehouse compute engine that runs SQL on Iceberg, Delta and Hudi in your own cloud account.",
  "description": "e6data is a commercial query engine for open lakehouse formats that deploys into the customer's own cloud account (AWS, Azure or GCP) and queries Iceberg, Delta Lake and Hudi tables through existing catalogs. Its pitch is a disaggregated, decentralized architecture that scales capacity in single-vCPU increments, aiming for lower and more predictable cost than Spark, Trino or warehouse compute on high-concurrency workloads. Newer products add streaming ingest and agent-oriented tooling. It is a young, venture-funded vendor, so evaluate it on your own workloads.",
